//    "At what performance.now() time will this audio sample be heard?"
//    "Are they the same?"
//
//  This is fundamentally different from v6.x which asked:
//    "Where is mediaEl.currentTime?"
//    "Where is video.currentTime?"
//    "Subtract some latency estimates"
