//    0-1.5ms:    LOCK (no correction)
//    1.5-3ms:    Observe (record only)
//    3-8ms:      Frequency correction (tiny, P-only)
//    8-20ms:     Frequency correction (PI)
//    20-40ms:    Frequency correction (PID, aggressive)
//    40-80ms:    Decide: frequency vs phase recovery
//    80-120ms:   Phase recovery (stop + restart source at correct offset)
//    120ms+:     Emergency phase recovery
//    discontinuity: State machine recovery

// ── Correction zones (ms) ────────────────────────────────────────
