    log('INFO', 'Boot', 'v9.9.0: THE ECO ROUND — (1) ECO: the load watch is an opt-in back-face card (factory OFF — no dot, no delays, full cadences; ON restores the full system); (2) RESTORE AUDIO: three quick taps (800ms window), the yellow state bar carries the arm, an ON flip disarms (no memory — the sneak + dead-controls fix); (3) TOTAL SILENCE: every auto note retired, the head strip deleted, the long-hold descriptions tell the current state, the fullscreen-exit fold rides the dynamic bar\'s minimum indication (silent without the bar)');
